{"Title":"An Act relative to school transportation personnel ","BillNumber":"S283","DocketNumber":"SD1235","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AMG0","Name":"Anne M. Gobi","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMG0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T12:32:10.787"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AMG0","Name":"Anne M. Gobi","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMG0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T12:32:10.7866667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S283/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Ms. Gobi, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 283) of Anne M. Gobi for legislation relative to school transportation personnel.  Education.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1.  Section 55A of chapter 71 of the General Laws, as so appearing in the 2022 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after the word “nurse” in line 15 the following:- ; school transportation vehicle driver or monitor \r\n\tSECTION 2.  Section 55A of chapter 71, as so appearing, is hereby further amended by inserting after the word “thereof” in line 19 the following:-  , on a school transportation vehicle or at a school bus stop \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J14","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J14"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}